From 91e92c16983077d89637a142644a4cddcba21428 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FitPaisa Engineer <engineer@fitpaisa.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:19:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ads, rewards, security): update Unity Ads manager, delta
 step conversion, and wallet security

- AdsConfig.kt: Game ID 800410563, placement BP_Rewarded_Android, dynamic UNITY_TEST_MODE via BuildConfig.DEBUG (real ads on signed release APK).
- AdManager.kt: Add 3.5s warm-up await loop, auto-retry backoff, UnityAds.setDebugMode, and verbose logcat tagging.
- sync-steps: Fix Postgres 23505 duplicate key bug by using delta range in source_id so multi-conversions per day succeed without dropping coins.
- request-cashout: Enforce 11-digit Pakistani phone validation and 1 pending cashout limit.
- 015_wallet_security.sql: Add pg_advisory_xact_lock against double-spend races, single-pending cashout limit, and view_sybil_wallet_alerts.
